{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2023-06", "window": 2, "start_date": 1686182400, "end_date": 1686873599, "month_true_total": 191, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 18:03:23 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "140130015", "author": {"steamid": "76561199131537774", "personaname": "THEMEOWBALLS", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199131537774/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 1536, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 640, "last_played": 1750041461, "avatar": "14fa45d90d1774068441651602af9b2de61890b4"}, "language": "english", "review": "space marines is an amazing game full of customisation and a long lore based story, this game will keep you busy and not make you bored. the story is very diverse compared to most Warhammer games putting you at the front lines as a captain of the Ultramarines and understanding what your mission is. the multiplayer is fun and full of excitement, giving players a great experience with both chaos and space marine factions. both teams will get their own classes aswell and will play how you have picked them, it will also keep you busy with its horde mode allowing plahyers to do 10-20 hordes of both Orks and chaos. you will also get the chance to play against astra militaurm and orks as choas. again an amazing and thrilling game especially how old it is.", "timestamp_created": 1686872476, "timestamp_updated": 1686872476, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "140105451", "author": {"steamid": "76561198053550581", "personaname": "Diaz Ex Machina", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/emperordiz/", "num_games_owned": 424, "num_reviews": 41, "playtime_forever": 310, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 226, "last_played": 1694014884, "avatar": "833693bcbb2cb02678ca3d32eaab4739457e441a"}, "language": "english", "review": "Fun for the whole family.", "timestamp_created": 1686843988, "timestamp_updated": 1686843988, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "140081027", "author": {"steamid": "76561198188755482", "personaname": "OBC1738", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198188755482/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 3310, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2528, "last_played": 1725419713, "avatar": "f8fa398508d37591b9af1dfd3b58d7926c02e53e"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great game", "timestamp_created": 1686802981, "timestamp_updated": 1686802981, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "140078510", "author": {"steamid": "76561198043111734", "personaname": "Alzack13", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198043111734/", "num_games_owned": 470, "num_reviews": 66, "playtime_forever": 381, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 381, "last_played": 1686797149, "avatar": "063d69828ae0b05ca28680addecbd3376abfe968"}, "language": "english", "review": "A lot of fun, better than I expected going in. Guns and melee felt good, enemy variety was excellent, felt very 40k. Exactly as long as it needed to be as well, which is rare. Criticisms would be that the \"executions\" should have made you invulnerable like in Doom 2016 (which came out years later so fair enough) and the visuals get repetitive as the entire game is one long mission.", "timestamp_created": 1686797812, "timestamp_updated": 1686797812, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "140054103", "author": {"steamid": "76561198026565390", "personaname": "leithal", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/leithalweapon/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 62, "playtime_forever": 477, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 477, "last_played": 1686759512, "avatar": "acfa445a814bc0ca71028358516c0078a6b195a9"}, "language": "english", "review": "I can see why the sequel has been so eagerly awaited - this game is simply fun to play. As someone who gets confused by the extensive and often overwhelming lore of 40k, I still had a great time playing this. The weapons feel great, the characters are interesting and well acted, and I find myself wanting more. By no means is this a game of the year from year's past, but dang it if it isn't a bunch of fun to blast away at the boyz.", "timestamp_created": 1686759719, "timestamp_updated": 1686759719, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}]}